      "abstract": "Preclinical characterization showing high affinity for both GLP-1R and GCGR. Mechanism studies demonstrate enhanced energy expenditure via glucagon component. Foundation for clinical development."
    },
    {
      "id": "PMID:35913766",
      "type": "pubmed",
      "title": "First-in-human study of BI 456906, a dual glucagon/GLP-1 receptor agonist, shows safety and dose-dependent glucodynamic effects",
      "authors": [
        "Parker VE",
        "Robertson D",
        "Wang T",
        "et al."
      ],
